 ```
 
+### `applyMergePatch(target, patch)`
+
+Applies a [JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386) to a target JSON document and
+returns the merged document as a new value; it does not mutate `target` or `patch`. Object members
+of `patch` are merged into `target` recursively; a `null` member removes the corresponding member
+from `target`. Any other patch value, including an array, replaces the corresponding target value
+wholesale.
+
+```ts
+import { applyMergePatch } from 'json-toolkit';
+
+const target = { a: 'b', c: { d: 'e', f: 'g' } };
+applyMergePatch(target, { a: 'z', c: { f: null } });
+// { a: 'z', c: { d: 'e' } }
+```
+
 ## Development
 
 - `npm test` runs the test suite.
